26lj|n|A shade for the face, projecting from the bonnet.	V:1wa7,25,1~1wa7,25,1
26lj|a|Offensive to the sight; contrary to beauty; being of disagreeable or loathsome aspect; unsightly; repulsive; deformed. ; Ill-natured; crossgrained; quarrelsome; as, an ugly temper; to feel ugly. ; Unpleasant; disagreeable; likely to cause trouble or loss; as, an ugly rumor; an ugly customer.	j:1wa7,25,1~1wa7,25,1	e:1psw,11,1~1psw,11,1
